review / pass2	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-08-15T07:20:05.0482594Z order, compute `available/required` ratio across all leaf components and 
review / pass2	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-08-15T07:20:05.0482958Z workcenters; the resource with the lowest ratio below 1.0 is the 
review / pass2	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-08-15T07:20:05.0483208Z `limiting_resource`, with **ASCII order as tie-break**.
